flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Scan job queue]
    B --> C[Next job in queue]
    C --> D{"Eligible?<br>(status = not_started)"}
    D -->|No| C
    D -->|Yes| E{"Earliest submission<br>so far?"}
    E -->|No| C
    E -->|Yes| F[Track as candidate]
    F --> C
    C -.->|All scanned| G{Candidate found?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Return earliest eligible job]
    G -->|No| I[Return empty]
    H --> J([End])
    I --> J
